OL,3,GNEWSAFamilies of A5 crash victims
OL,4,Awelcome ruling on road upgrade
OL,5,
OL,6,FOver the past two decades, more than 50
OL,7,Fpeople have died as a result of crashes
OL,8,Fon the A5 - a road where planned
OL,9,Fredevelopments have been beset by
OL,10,Ffunding and legal issues.
OL,12,FNow a judge's ruling that blocked
OL,13,Fupgrade work to the road has been
OL,14,Foverturned by the Court of Appeal.
OL,16,FIt paves the way for the building of a
OL,17,FA5 new dual carriageway through
OL,18,Fcounties Londonderry and Tyrone -
OL,19,Fsomething that the families of those
OL,20,Fwho died on the road have said should
OL,21,Fhave happened years ago.
OL,23,APub: 06-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,418,410,260,120,0,100
