OL,3,GNEWSAFamilies of A5 crash victims
OL,4,Awelcome ruling on road upgrade
OL,5,
OL,6,FThey have welcomed the appeal court
OL,7,Fjudgment and want the work to begin as
OL,8,Fsoon as possible, although others have
OL,9,Fconcerns that they could lose their
OL,10,Fhomes to make way for the new road.
